        "html": "<div style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 12px;background:#f2f7fb;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 26px;color:#072a45;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;\">Siam Hotel &amp; Hostel</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;color:#5b7386;\">Sairee Beach · Koh Tao</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Hi {{name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Thank you so much for wanting to stay with us. We have checked at reception, and unfortunately <strong>{{roomName}}</strong> is not available for {{checkIn}} - {{checkOut}}.</p>{{#alternative}}<div style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#f2f7fb;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">What we can offer instead: {{alternative}}</div>{{/alternative}}<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Message us on WhatsApp and we will do our best to find something that works for you:</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0;\"><a href=\"{{waLink}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1da851;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;\">Chat on WhatsApp</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#5b7386;\">Or have another look at our rooms: <a href=\"{{hotelUrl}}\" style=\"color:#0b4a8f;\">{{hotelUrl}}</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Hope to host you soon,<br/>Siam Hotel &amp; Hostel</p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#8aa0b2;\">Ref {{ref}}</p></div></div>"
      },
      "he": {
        "subject": "לגבי הבקשה שלך - סיאם מלון והוסטל ({{ref}})",
        "html": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 12px;background:#f2f7fb;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:right;\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 26px;color:#072a45;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;\">Siam Hotel &amp; Hostel</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;color:#5b7386;\">Sairee Beach · Koh Tao</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">היי {{name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">תודה רבה שרציתם להתארח אצלנו. בדקנו בקבלה, ולצערנו <strong>{{roomName}}</strong> לא זמין בתאריכים {{checkIn}} - {{checkOut}}.</p>{{#alternative}}<div style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#f2f7fb;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">מה שכן נוכל להציע: {{alternative}}</div>{{/alternative}}<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">כתבו לנו בוואטסאפ ונעשה כמיטב יכולתנו למצוא פתרון שיתאים לכם:</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0;\"><a href=\"{{waLink}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1da851;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;\">לצ'אט בוואטסאפ</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#5b7386;\">או העיפו עוד מבט בחדרים שלנו: <a href=\"{{hotelUrl}}\" style=\"color:#0b4a8f;\">{{hotelUrl}}</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">מקווים לארח אתכם בקרוב,<br/>סיאם מלון והוסטל</p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#8aa0b2;\">Ref {{ref}}</p></div></div>"
      },
      "es": {
        "subject": "Sobre tu solicitud - Siam Hotel & Hostel ({{ref}})",
        "html": "<div style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 12px;background:#f2f7fb;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 26px;color:#072a45;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;\">Siam Hotel &amp; Hostel</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;color:#5b7386;\">Sairee Beach · Koh Tao</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Hola {{name}}:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Muchas gracias por querer alojarte con nosotros. Lo hemos comprobado en recepción y, por desgracia, <strong>{{roomName}}</strong> no está disponible del {{checkIn}} al {{checkOut}}.</p>{{#alternative}}<div style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#f2f7fb;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Lo que sí podemos ofrecerte: {{alternative}}</div>{{/alternative}}<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Escríbenos por WhatsApp y haremos todo lo posible por encontrar algo que te encaje:</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0;\"><a href=\"{{waLink}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1da851;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;\">Chatear por WhatsApp</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#5b7386;\">O vuelve a echar un vistazo a nuestras habitaciones: <a href=\"{{hotelUrl}}\" style=\"color:#0b4a8f;\">{{hotelUrl}}</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Esperamos recibirte pronto,<br/>Siam Hotel &amp; Hostel</p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#8aa0b2;\">Ref {{ref}}</p></div></div>"
      },
      "fr": {
        "subject": "À propos de votre demande - Siam Hotel & Hostel ({{ref}})",
        "html": "<div style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 12px;background:#f2f7fb;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 26px;color:#072a45;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 2px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;\">Siam Hotel &amp; Hostel</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;color:#5b7386;\">Sairee Beach · Koh Tao</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Bonjour {{name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Merci beaucoup d'avoir voulu séjourner chez nous. Nous avons vérifié à la réception et, malheureusement, <strong>{{roomName}}</strong> n'est pas disponible du {{checkIn}} au {{checkOut}}.</p>{{#alternative}}<div style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#f2f7fb;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Ce que nous pouvons proposer à la place : {{alternative}}</div>{{/alternative}}<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Écrivez-nous sur WhatsApp et nous ferons de notre mieux pour trouver une solution :</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0;\"><a href=\"{{waLink}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1da851;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;\">Discuter sur WhatsApp</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#5b7386;\">Ou jetez un autre coup d'œil à nos chambres : <a href=\"{{hotelUrl}}\" style=\"color:#0b4a8f;\">{{hotelUrl}}</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;\">Au plaisir de vous accueillir,<br/>Siam Hotel &amp; Hostel</p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#8aa0b2;\">Ref {{ref}}</p></div></div>"
      }
    }
